Jimmy: Welcome friend
- Hello...
	P: Hello...Who are you?
	Jimmy: I go by many names, but you may call me Jimmy.
- What are you doing out here?
	P: What are you doing out here? Meditating?
	Jimmy: Waiting for you my friend.
Jimmy: I'm delighted you are finally here.
P: Why?
Jimmy: It's time I teach you to fly.
P: ...
P: I didn't see any shrooms on the way here...was that your doing?
Jimmy: Very funny, no my friend. You will be able to pivot while in the air. 
P: Yeahhh so look I'm just trying to explo-
Jimmy: *mutters a spell to himself*
Jimmy: There you go, give it a shot. Press space while in the air.
set Gameplay.DJ = true
=> END1

